WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.078
Rat and Mole waited for the door to open.

2
00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:22.692
But it didn't open any further.

3
00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:27.674
"Who woke me up?" cried an angry voice.

4
00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:32.553
"Can't a badger get some sleep?"

5
00:00:32.554 --> 00:00:35.071
"Oh, Badger," said Rat.

6
00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:36.363
"Let us in.

7
00:00:36.364 --> 00:00:39.020
It's Rat, and my friend Mole.

8
00:00:39.021 --> 00:00:41.538
We lost our way in the snow."

9
00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:45.481
Suddenly the door swung wide open.

10
00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:51.341
"Why Ratty! Come on in!" cried Badger.

11
00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:54.206
"Lost in the Wild Wood?

12
00:00:54.207 --> 00:00:58.136
My friends, you are soaking wet!"

13
00:00:58.137 --> 00:01:01.950
Badger quickly shut the door behind them.

14
00:01:01.951 --> 00:01:05.935
Badger wore a long dressing gown.

15
00:01:05.936 --> 00:01:09.224
On his feet were large slippers.

16
00:01:09.225 --> 00:01:12.347
He held a candle in his paw.

17
00:01:12.348 --> 00:01:16.341
"Thank you, Mr. Badger," said Mole.

18
00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.652
Badger looked kindly at Rat and Mole.

19
00:01:19.653 --> 00:01:22.341
"Come into the kitchen," he said.

20
00:01:22.342 --> 00:01:26.739
"There's a fire and some supper too."

21
00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:31.473
Badger led them down a long hallway.

22
00:01:31.474 --> 00:01:36.146
"I am so hungry!" Mole said to Rat.

23
00:01:36.147 --> 00:01:39.219
"Me too!" agreed Rat.

24
00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:42.610
"Here we are," said Badger.

25
00:01:42.611 --> 00:01:47.697
He held open the door to a cozy kitchen.

26
00:01:47.698 --> 00:01:51.351
"Sit by the fire," Badger told them.

27
00:01:51.352 --> 00:01:57.162
"Take off those wet coats. Boots too!"

28
00:01:57.163 --> 00:02:01.477
Badger gave them robes and slippers to wear.

29
00:02:01.478 --> 00:02:05.776
"Now let me get you some dinner."

30
00:02:05.777 --> 00:02:09.870
Badger brought them plates of hot food.

31
00:02:09.871 --> 00:02:13.939
Soon they were warm and dry.

32
00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:17.339
Mole looked at Badger's friendly face.

33
00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:25.290
"I have finally met Badger," thought Mole.
